concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Simplified outline of this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "This Act sets up the Australian Business Securitisation Fund.   Preliminary  Part 1  Section 5  No. 46, 2019 Australian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019  The Fund consists of the Australian Business Securitisation Fund Special Account and the investments of the Fund. The investments of the Fund must be debt securities that meet certain requirements. The Minister is responsible for making investment decisions for the Fund, however, the Minister may delegate the power to make these decisions. Investment decisions must be made in accordance with any directions given by the Minister." ;
    skos:definition "This Act sets up the Australian Business Securitisation Fund.   Preliminary  Part 1  Section 5  No. 46, 2019 Australian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019  The Fund consists of the Australian Business Securitisation Fund Special Account and the investments of the Fund. The investments of the Fund must be debt securities that meet certain requirements. The Minister is responsible for making investment decisions for the Fund, however, the Minister may delegate the power to make these decisions. Investment decisions must be made in accordance with any directions given by the Minister."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1e9671e87f25893b759ffae6ecd30be9e2a288d30f988d956ec7e1296b9489ff" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Minister must make investment decisions for the Fund in accordance with directions given by the Minister." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019.pdf, p.6" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-4-norm .
