concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 Credits to the Account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "(1) There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to the following:  (a) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2019;  (b) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2020;  (c) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2021;  (d) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2022;  (e) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2023;  (f) income derived from an investment of the Fund;  (g) a return of capital, or any other financial distribution, relating to an investment of the Fund;  (h) the proceeds of the realisation of an investment of the Fund.  (2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, determine that an amount equal to a specified amount is to be credited to the Account at a time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the determination.  (3) The time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the determination must be on or after the time the determination is made.  (4) The determination must be expressed to be for a specified budget year.  (5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister must obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the determination." ;
    skos:definition "(1) There must be credited to the Account amounts equal to the following:  (a) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2019;  (b) $250 million, to be credited on 1 July 2020;  (c) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2021;  (d) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2022;  (e) $500 million, to be credited on 1 July 2023;  (f) income derived from an investment of the Fund;  (g) a return of capital, or any other financial distribution, relating to an investment of the Fund;  (h) the proceeds of the realisation of an investment of the Fund.  (2) The Minister may, by notifiable instrument, determine that an amount equal to a specified amount is to be credited to the Account at a time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the determination.  (3) The time specified in, or ascertained in accordance with, the determination must be on or after the time the determination is made.  (4) The determination must be expressed to be for a specified budget year.  (5) Before making a determination under subsection (2), the Minister must obtain the agreement of the Finance Minister to the determination."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a74452e301a8805908cd5be8499fa93ddeedad1d4b0c00e914fabffcb9dcd1ab" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-14-ss-5 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
