doc:sec-15 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15 Purposes of the Account" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The purposes of the Account are as follows:  (a) paying the costs of the making of an investment under section 12;  (b) paying or discharging any other costs, expenses and other obligations incurred by the Commonwealth exclusively in connection with the Fund;   The Australian Business Securitisation Fund  Part 2  Section 16  No. 46, 2019 Australian Business Securitisation Fund Act 2019  (c) reducing the balance of the Account under section 16 (and therefore the available appropriation for the Account) without making a real or notional payment." ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Reducing the balance of the Account"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by writing, direct that a specified amount is to be debited from the Account on a specified day (which must be on or after the day the direction is made).  (2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  (3) The Minister must give a copy of a direction under subsection (1) to the Finance Minister." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by writing, direct that a specified amount is to be debited from the Account on a specified day (which must be on or after the day the direction is made).  (2) A direction under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  (3) The Minister must give a copy of a direction under subsection (1) to the Finance Minister."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8cf20d223b71d529ad45f7b01e88efaf1c41911e8763067258775f0cb0cea4ac" ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer ;
