concept:australian-business-securitisation-fund-act-2019-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Review of operation of this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken as soon as possible after each of the following:  (a) the second anniversary of the commencement of this Act;  (b) the fifth anniversary of the commencement of this Act.  (2) The review must include a review of the effectiveness of this Act in meeting the objectives of this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause a review of the operation of this Act to be undertaken as soon as possible after each of the following:  (a) the second anniversary of the commencement of this Act;  (b) the fifth anniversary of the commencement of this Act.  (2) The review must include a review of the effectiveness of this Act in meeting the objectives of this Act."@en ;
